WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:09.000
One folder holds the rules, skills and agents for my AI tools

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.000
deno task ai renders it for Claude Code, OpenCode and DSH

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:22.000
The same reviewer agent, written in each tool's own format

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:28.500
Edit one line in the source: the reviewer becomes "strict"

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:33.000
Render again: one file changes in each tool

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:40.300
All three copies now say "strict"

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:44.000
Now someone edits one copy by hand

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:49.000
The check finds the drift and fails with exit 1

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:56.200
deno task ai puts it back, and everything is in sync again
